---
// Post 20 (Alpha) figure: bestofn. Inline SVG, site tokens only. Numbers come from the Python runs recorded in the post brief.
---
<figure class="atp20-bestofn">
  <div class="atp20-bestofn-scroll">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 900 350" role="img" aria-label="Bars of expected best Sharpe for N zero-skill formulas on three years of data: 1 formula gives 0, 10 gives 0.91, 100 gives 1.46, 1,000 gives 1.88, 10,000 gives 2.23, 100,000 gives 2.54.">
<text x="20" y="28" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>Best of N formulas that have zero skill, three years of daily data</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Tốt nhất trong N công thức không có chút kỹ năng nào, ba năm dữ liệu ngày</tspan></text>
<text x="20" y="50" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>Expected best annualised Sharpe ratio. Higher bars are the same noise, searched harder.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Sharpe năm hoá kỳ vọng của công thức tốt nhất. Thanh cao hơn là cùng một lượng nhiễu, tìm kỹ hơn.</tspan></text>
<line x1="90" y1="290" x2="860" y2="290" class="ax" />
<line x1="90" y1="215.0" x2="860" y2="215.0" class="mutl" />
<text x="92" y="76" class="xs"><tspan data-lang-en>Dashed line = Sharpe 1, which looks like a real strategy</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Đường đứt = Sharpe 1, trông như một chiến lược thật</tspan></text>
<text x="165" y="282" class="b" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>0.00</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>0,00</tspan></text>
<text x="165" y="310" class="s" text-anchor="middle">1</text>
<rect x="255" y="222" width="70" height="68" rx="3" class="box" />
<text x="290" y="213.75" class="b" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>0.91</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>0,91</tspan></text>
<text x="290" y="310" class="s" text-anchor="middle">10</text>
<rect x="380" y="180" width="70" height="110" rx="3" class="badb" />
<text x="415" y="172.5" class="b" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>1.46</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>1,46</tspan></text>
<text x="415" y="310" class="s" text-anchor="middle">100</text>
<rect x="505" y="149" width="70" height="141" rx="3" class="badb" />
<text x="540" y="141.0" class="b" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>1.88</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>1,88</tspan></text>
<text x="540" y="310" class="s" text-anchor="middle">1,000</text>
<rect x="630" y="123" width="70" height="167" rx="3" class="badb" />
<text x="665" y="114.75" class="b" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>2.23</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>2,23</tspan></text>
<text x="665" y="310" class="s" text-anchor="middle">10,000</text>
<rect x="755" y="100" width="70" height="190" rx="3" class="badb" />
<text x="790" y="91.5" class="b" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>2.54</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>2,54</tspan></text>
<text x="790" y="310" class="s" text-anchor="middle">100,000</text>
<text x="475" y="334" class="s" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>number of formulas tried (all with true Sharpe 0)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>số công thức đã thử (tất cả có Sharpe thật bằng 0)</tspan></text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Computed from the extreme-value formula for the maximum of N normal draws; a Monte Carlo run agrees within 0.03.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Tính từ công thức giá trị cực đại của N mẫu chuẩn; chạy Monte Carlo cho kết quả lệch không quá 0,03.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .atp20-bestofn { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
